  {
   "t": 0,
   "text": "This one stops your team pressing on hope and starts them pressing on evidence.",
   "hold": 2.5,
   "beat": "hook"
  },
  {
   "t": 0,
   "text": "A normal possession game, two small goals each end, and one extra rule.",
   "hold": 2.5,
   "beat": "picture"
  },
  {
   "t": 2.71,
   "text": "The defending team holds shape until a trigger. Backward pass, bad touch, or facing their own goal.",
   "hold": 2.5,
   "beat": "action"
  },
  {
   "t": 9.02,
   "text": "Then the nearest player closes down and finishes quickly in either small goal.",
   "hold": 2.5,
   "beat": "action"
  },
  {
   "t": 15.04,
   "text": "Once they read it, let them call the trigger and you stay silent.",
   "hold": 2.5,
   "beat": "progression"
  },
  {
   "t": 17.54,
   "text": "A press without a trigger concedes a point. Harsh, until you watch the shape hold.",
